{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51911","headline":"题壁 · 无名氏","name":"题壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一团茅草乱蓬蓬，蓦地烧天蓦地空。\n争似满炉煨榾柮，慢腾腾地煖烘烘。\n〖1〗（以上江标影刻南宋书棚本《唐人五十家小集》（〖1〗《许彦周诗话》称宣和癸卯年游嵩山峻极中院，见法堂後檐壁间有此诗，「字画极草草」，旁有司马光书「勿毁此诗」四字。\n又见《贵耳集》卷上。\n〖2〗以上三，原收归韦毂名下，今移作无名氏诗，详《修订说明》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}